; Multi-currency journal mixing USD and EUR. The @ price annotation is used
; only on the buy-side (where USD->EUR conversion balances against a USD
; debit). For EUR-denominated expenses, both sides stay in EUR — that's how
; hledger and ledger both balance per-commodity.

account Assets:Cash:USD
account Assets:Cash:EUR
account Expenses:Travel

2024-08-01 * Buy EUR for trip
    Assets:Cash:EUR             100.00 EUR @ $1.10
    Assets:Cash:USD            -$110.00

2024-08-05 * Espresso in Rome
    Expenses:Travel               3.50 EUR
    Assets:Cash:EUR              -3.50 EUR
